        <p class="dashboard-search-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" data-work-status>Type your search, or use your voice, then choose Search.</p>
        <details class="dashboard-search-help"><summary id="work-voice-privacy">Voice privacy: audio may be processed online</summary><p class="dashboard-search-privacy">Voice starts only when you choose it. Your browser’s speech service may process audio online. Sourcing & Tender Management System does not upload or store audio.</p><p class="voice-settings-note">Language is remembered on this browser. Allow microphone access when prompted. If permission is blocked, change this site’s microphone permission in your browser settings. Typed search always remains available.</p></details>
